<title>ABU DHABI: SOCCER-ASIAN CUP FINAL SCHEDULE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ASIAN CUP FINAL SCHEDULE.</headline>
<dateline>ABU DHABI 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Line-up for the final and third-place playoff in the Asian Cup here on Saturday (all times GMT):</p>
<p>Third place playoff:  Kuwait   v  Iran   (1245)</p>
<p>Final:  United Arab Emirates v Saudi Arabia   (1535)</p>
</text>
